<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Simplified Chinese of values/strings.xml and
     values/jukebox_widget_strings.xml, name for name. Chinese does not change
     a noun after a number, so both quantities of a plural are one wording,
     with its measure word: "1 首歌曲", "3 首歌曲". Names stay as they are:
     Jukebox, YouTube, Android, Wi-Fi, MP3, FLAC, ID3. The terms are those of
     the app's own screens (src/lib/i18n/zh-Hans/index.ts): 音乐库, 歌单, 搜索,
     发现, 下载, 歌曲, 专辑, 艺人, 封面.

     The folder is the BCP-47 one, b+zh+Hans, because the app asks for its
     language by the tag "zh-Hans" (Localised.kt): a locale with a script and
     no region. Since API 24 Android matches a resource folder to such a locale
     by language and script, so this folder is found for zh-Hans exactly, and
     also for a phone set to zh-CN or zh-SG, whose script is worked out as Hans;
     it is not taken for zh-Hant (Taiwan, Hong Kong). -->
